 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.mark_returned(shipment_id) -> Shipment`: set status to "returned" and stamp `returned_at`. Raises `E_NOT_FOUND` if the shipment does not exist; `E_BAD_STATE` if its status is "created". Emits `shipment.returned`. Idempotent: an already-returned shipment is returned unchanged with no second event. Not a list.
 
 ## rates
 
